{"1": {"name": "SmartTabUI pendant video tutorials", "desc": "<p>Short videos of the SmartTabUI pendant, one topic at a time, from installing it to recovering a job.</p><ul><li><a href=\"#pendant-00-intro\">SmartTabUI in one minute</a></li><li><a href=\"#pendant-01-install\">Installing the pendant</a></li><li><a href=\"#pendant-02-settings\">Pendant settings</a></li><li><a href=\"#pendant-03-jogging\">The screen and jogging</a></li><li><a href=\"#pendant-04-home-probe\">Homing and probing</a></li><li><a href=\"#pendant-05-files-run\">Files, Prepare and Run</a></li><li><a href=\"#pendant-06-during-job\">During a job</a></li><li><a href=\"#pendant-07-recovery\">Job recovery</a></li><li><a href=\"#pendant-08-measure-record\">Measure and Record</a></li><li><a href=\"#pendant-09-macros-webui\">Macros, Term and the WebUI</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"pendant-00-intro\">SmartTabUI in one minute</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-00-intro.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-00-intro.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>The handheld pendant for FluidNC: jog, home, probe and run jobs from the SD card, next to the WebUI. (0:55)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"pendant-01-install\">Installing the pendant</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-01-install.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-01-install.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>One GX12 cable, a few lines in the controller&#x27;s config, and the firmware from dpcreator.eu. (1:27)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"pendant-02-settings\">Pendant settings</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-02-settings.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-02-settings.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Theme, machine type, the P6 button, DRO axes, brightness and volume, kept on the pendant itself. (1:21)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"pendant-03-jogging\">The screen and jogging</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-03-jogging.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-03-jogging.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>The DRO, jogging with the handwheel and step, and the feed, rapid and spindle overrides. (1:07)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"pendant-04-home-probe\">Homing and probing</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-04-home-probe.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-04-home-probe.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>The Home tab: home all or one axis, work offsets G54 to G59, zero, and the probing cycles. (1:17)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"pendant-05-files-run\">Files, Prepare and Run</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-05-files-run.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-05-files-run.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Pick a job on the SD card, view its toolpath, prepare and start it. (1:17)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"pendant-06-during-job\">During a job</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-06-during-job.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-06-during-job.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Z adjust while cutting, Hold, Rewind and Abort. (1:18)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"pendant-07-recovery\">Job recovery</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-07-recovery.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-07-recovery.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Carry on after a power cut, an E-stop or an alarm, from the line you choose. (1:15)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"pendant-08-measure-record\">Measure and Record</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-08-measure-record.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-08-measure-record.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Double-tap ENABLE: measure a part from its corners, or record waypoints, with the WebUI. (1:26)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"pendant-09-macros-webui\">Macros, Term and the WebUI</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-09-macros-webui.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-09-macros-webui.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Run macros and commands from the pendant, and how it works together with the WebUI. (1:19)</figcaption></figure><p>See also the <a href=\"/docs/webui-video-tutorials\">WebUI video tutorials</a> and the <a href=\"/docs/studio-video-tutorials\">Studio video tutorials</a>.</p>", "meta": "Short videos of the SmartTabUI pendant for FluidNC: install, settings, jogging, homing and probing, running jobs, job recovery and more."}, "2": {"name": "SmartTabUI pults video pamācības", "desc": "<p>Īsi video par SmartTabUI pulti, katrs par vienu tēmu, no uzstādīšanas līdz darba atjaunošanai.</p><p>Video ir angļu valodā.</p><ul><li><a href=\"#pendant-00-intro\">SmartTabUI vienā minūtē</a></li><li><a href=\"#pendant-01-install\">Pults uzstādīšana</a></li><li><a href=\"#pendant-02-settings\">Pults iestatījumi</a></li><li><a href=\"#pendant-03-jogging\">Ekrāns un pārvietošana</a></li><li><a href=\"#pendant-04-home-probe\">Homing un zondēšana</a></li><li><a href=\"#pendant-05-files-run\">Faili, sagatavošana un palaišana</a></li><li><a href=\"#pendant-06-during-job\">Darba laikā</a></li><li><a href=\"#pendant-07-recovery\">Darba atjaunošana</a></li><li><a href=\"#pendant-08-measure-record\">Mērīšana un ierakstīšana</a></li><li><a href=\"#pendant-09-macros-webui\">Makro, Term un WebUI</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"pendant-00-intro\">SmartTabUI vienā minūtē</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-00-intro.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-00-intro.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Rokas pults FluidNC: pārvietošana, homing, zondēšana un darbi no SD kartes, kopā ar WebUI. (0:55)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"pendant-01-install\">Pults uzstādīšana</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-01-install.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-01-install.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Viens GX12 kabelis, dažas rindas kontroliera konfigurācijā un programmaparatūra no dpcreator.eu. (1:27)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"pendant-02-settings\">Pults iestatījumi</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-02-settings.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-02-settings.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Tēma, mašīnas tips, P6 poga, DRO asis, spilgtums un skaļums, saglabāti pašā pultī. (1:21)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"pendant-03-jogging\">Ekrāns un pārvietošana</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-03-jogging.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-03-jogging.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>DRO, pārvietošana ar ratu un soli, padeves, ātrgaitas un vārpstas korekcijas. (1:07)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"pendant-04-home-probe\">Homing un zondēšana</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-04-home-probe.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-04-home-probe.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Home cilne: visu vai vienas ass homing, nobīdes G54–G59, nullēšana un zondēšanas cikli. (1:17)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"pendant-05-files-run\">Faili, sagatavošana un palaišana</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-05-files-run.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-05-files-run.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Izvēlieties darbu SD kartē, apskatiet rīka ceļu, sagatavojiet un palaidiet. (1:17)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"pendant-06-during-job\">Darba laikā</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-06-during-job.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-06-during-job.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Z korekcija griešanas laikā, Hold, Rewind un Abort. (1:18)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"pendant-07-recovery\">Darba atjaunošana</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-07-recovery.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-07-recovery.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Turpiniet pēc strāvas pārrāvuma, E-stop vai trauksmes, no izvēlētās rindas. (1:15)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"pendant-08-measure-record\">Mērīšana un ierakstīšana</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-08-measure-record.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-08-measure-record.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Divreiz piesitiet ENABLE: izmēriet detaļu pēc stūriem vai ierakstiet punktus, kopā ar WebUI. (1:26)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"pendant-09-macros-webui\">Makro, Term un WebUI</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-09-macros-webui.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-09-macros-webui.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Makro un komandas no pults, un kā pults strādā kopā ar WebUI. (1:19)</figcaption></figure><p>Skatiet arī <a href=\"/docs/webui-video-tutorials\">WebUI video pamācības</a> un <a href=\"/docs/studio-video-tutorials\">Studio video pamācības</a>.</p>", "meta": "Īsi video par SmartTabUI pulti FluidNC: uzstādīšana, iestatījumi, pārvietošana, homing, darbi un darba atjaunošana."}, "3": {"name": "SmartTabUI Video-Tutorials", "desc": "<p>Kurze Videos zum SmartTabUI-Handbediengerät, jeweils ein Thema, von der Installation bis zur Job-Wiederaufnahme.</p><p>Die Videos sind auf Englisch.</p><ul><li><a href=\"#pendant-00-intro\">SmartTabUI in einer Minute</a></li><li><a href=\"#pendant-01-install\">Das Handbediengerät installieren</a></li><li><a href=\"#pendant-02-settings\">Einstellungen am Handbediengerät</a></li><li><a href=\"#pendant-03-jogging\">Bildschirm und Verfahren</a></li><li><a href=\"#pendant-04-home-probe\">Referenzieren und Antasten</a></li><li><a href=\"#pendant-05-files-run\">Dateien, Vorbereiten und Starten</a></li><li><a href=\"#pendant-06-during-job\">Während eines Jobs</a></li><li><a href=\"#pendant-07-recovery\">Job-Wiederaufnahme</a></li><li><a href=\"#pendant-08-measure-record\">Messen und Aufzeichnen</a></li><li><a href=\"#pendant-09-macros-webui\">Makros, Term und das WebUI</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"pendant-00-intro\">SmartTabUI in einer Minute</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-00-intro.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-00-intro.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Das Handbediengerät für FluidNC: verfahren, referenzieren, antasten und Jobs von der SD-Karte starten, neben dem WebUI. (0:55)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"pendant-01-install\">Das Handbediengerät installieren</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-01-install.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-01-install.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Ein GX12-Kabel, ein paar Zeilen in der Controller-Konfiguration und die Firmware von dpcreator.eu. (1:27)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"pendant-02-settings\">Einstellungen am Handbediengerät</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-02-settings.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-02-settings.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Design, Maschinentyp, P6-Taste, DRO-Achsen, Helligkeit und Lautstärke, auf dem Gerät gespeichert. (1:21)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"pendant-03-jogging\">Bildschirm und Verfahren</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-03-jogging.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-03-jogging.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Die DRO, Verfahren mit Handrad und Schrittweite, Overrides für Vorschub, Eilgang und Spindel. (1:07)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"pendant-04-home-probe\">Referenzieren und Antasten</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-04-home-probe.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-04-home-probe.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Der Home-Tab: alle oder eine Achse referenzieren, Nullpunkte G54 bis G59, nullen und Antastzyklen. (1:17)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"pendant-05-files-run\">Dateien, Vorbereiten und Starten</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-05-files-run.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-05-files-run.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Einen Job auf der SD-Karte wählen, die Werkzeugbahn ansehen, vorbereiten und starten. (1:17)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"pendant-06-during-job\">Während eines Jobs</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-06-during-job.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-06-during-job.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Z-Korrektur während des Fräsens, Hold, Rewind und Abort. (1:18)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"pendant-07-recovery\">Job-Wiederaufnahme</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-07-recovery.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-07-recovery.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Nach Stromausfall, Not-Halt oder Alarm weitermachen, ab der gewählten Zeile. (1:15)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"pendant-08-measure-record\">Messen und Aufzeichnen</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-08-measure-record.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-08-measure-record.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>ENABLE doppelt tippen: ein Teil über die Ecken vermessen oder Wegpunkte aufzeichnen, mit dem WebUI. (1:26)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"pendant-09-macros-webui\">Makros, Term und das WebUI</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-09-macros-webui.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/pendant-09-macros-webui.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Makros und Befehle vom Handbediengerät, und wie es mit dem WebUI zusammenarbeitet. (1:19)</figcaption></figure><p>Siehe auch die <a href=\"/docs/webui-video-tutorials\">WebUI-Video-Tutorials</a> und die <a href=\"/docs/studio-video-tutorials\">Studio-Video-Tutorials</a>.</p>", "meta": "Kurze Videos zum SmartTabUI-Handbediengerät für FluidNC: Installation, Einstellungen, Verfahren, Referenzieren, Jobs und Wiederaufnahme."}, "4": {"name": "Видеоуроки пульта SmartTabUI", "desc": "<p>Короткие видео о пульте SmartTabUI, по одной теме, от установки до восстановления задания.</p><p>Видео на английском языке.</p><ul><li><a href=\"#pendant-00-intro\">SmartTabUI за одну минуту</a></li><li><a href=\"#pendant-01-install\">Установка пульта</a></li><li><a href=